@startuml
left to right direction

class Customer
class Order
class LineItem
interface PaymentGateway
class CardPayment

Customer "1" --> "0..*" Order : places
Order "1" *-- "1..*" LineItem : contains
CardPayment ..> PaymentGateway : authorizes through
PaymentGateway <|.. CardPayment : implements
Customer -right-> CardPayment : pays with
@enduml
